<view class="page">
  <view class="card"><view class="section-title">我的库存提醒</view><medicine-time-field value="{{preferences.stockReminderTime}}" disabled="{{savingPreferences}}" bindchange="onPreferenceChange" /><view class="hint">按上海时间提醒</view><view class="row"><view>微信渠道</view><switch checked="{{wechatEnabled}}" disabled="{{savingPreferences}}" data-channel="wechat" bindchange="onPreferenceChange" /></view><view class="row"><view>Android 渠道</view><switch checked="{{androidEnabled}}" disabled="{{savingPreferences}}" data-channel="android" bindchange="onPreferenceChange" /></view><view class="hint">渠道由你主动选择。开启微信仍需下方模板授权；Android 需在已连接的手机开启权限。两项都开时两端均会提醒。</view></view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">提醒设置</view>
    <view class="hint">订阅只会在你主动点击后请求微信授权。是否送达取决于模板可用性、授权结果和微信平台规则。</view>
    <view class="notice-status" wx:if="{{statusText}}">{{statusText}}</view>
    <view class="hint error-text" wx:if="{{errorMessage}}">{{errorMessage}}</view>
    <view class="hint" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在检查模板…</view>
    <view class="template-card" wx:for="{{templates}}" wx:key="templateId">
      <view class="template-title">{{item.title}}</view>
      <view class="template-state">{{item.available ? '可申请授权' : '暂不可用'}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="btn btn-primary {{subscribing || !canSubscribe ? 'disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="onTapSubscribe">
      {{subscribing ? "等待授权…" : "主动订阅微信提醒"}}
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">待处理事项</view>
    <view class="hint">当前 {{notifications.length}} 项。通知权限关闭时，事项仍会保留在药箱待处理页。</view>
    <view class="btn btn-ghost" bindtap="onOpenPending">打开待处理列表</view>
  </view>
</view>
